===== COMMIT 99276a92a941f19ab9efd78eb5e09a464277a948 =====
fix(thumbnail): align modal service calls with options-object contract

The modal's goGenerate/applyRefine/applyInpaint/goSave were calling the
new service methods with positional args, which silently dropped all
controls, presetKey, and reference image data. The edge function was
receiving only n:3 (or a string for n) and ignoring every user-selected
sidebar control. Same bug existed in defaultGenerateThumbnail in
uiIntegration.js.

Also fix ReferenceError in buildPrompts (variants.length → this.variants.length)
and the .thumb-modal__partial CSS overlay that was rendering the partial
preview behind an opaque black background.

- buildPrompts: destructure { variants, responseId } from service
- goGenerate: pass full controls as opts; destructure { candidates, params }
